ategory is never a technical pass. Review actual corrections rather than trusting author labels; never assert another review closed a finding without its artifact.\n\nSet independentDecision=accepted only when current revision\/digest and linked detail hashes are verified, strict owner proof\/source\/artifact\/cleanup checks pass, and no real high\/middle defect or indispensable experiment is open. Missing evidence or runtime\/round limits means rejected\/incomplete, never approval.\n\nReturn {\"when\":{\"always\":true},\"payload\":{...}} with workflowInput, revision, guidelinePath, guidelineSha256, independentDecision, reviewQuestions (all five keys), findings, findingDispositions, requestedExperiments, reviewEvidence (strings naming precise checks\/files\/hashes) and discussionHistory. Keep history by reference. Do not claim reviewer2 has run or final combined acceptance exists.\n\nFinal operational review. Read results\/reviews\/third-party-engineer-acceptance.json. Do not run DB\/Docker, mutate state, delegate or start workflows. Act as an unfamiliar service engineer following the instructions. Verify the actual current guide and calibration hashes and owner proof. No unsupported global safety\/accuracy claim; no resurrected exhaustive grids. Return the required SMALL adapter with actual evidence, not copied historical adapters.","systemPromptText":"Runtime variables are available under `runtimeVariables`. Use this JSON as the authoritative runtimeVariables object:\n`$rielaElidedKeys` lists message payload keys whose values equal the top-level runtimeVariables entry of the same name; `$rielaSameAs` points to an identical payload elsewhere in this object.\n{\"_rielaInput\":{\"communicationIds\":[],\"messages\":[],\"sourceStepIds\":[],\"stepId\":\"review\",\"workflowExecutionId\":\"temp-final-count-engineer-sol-session-33\"},\"calibrationPath\":\"docs\/table-count-calibration.md\",\"calibrationSha256\":\"99bfd0477a19c4cf1f0f60967aa37957073ae6283d68f959979bc72669cf